Third-party material
--------------------

EFF Large Wordlist for Passphrases
  KeepForge embeds the "EFF Large Wordlist for Passphrases" (7,776 words) to
  generate passphrases and readable user names (res/eff_large_wordlist.txt;
  the dice numbers of the original file were removed, the words are unchanged).
  Copyright Electronic Frontier Foundation.
  https://www.eff.org/deeplinks/2016/07/new-wordlists-random-passphrases
  Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 United States License
  (CC BY 3.0 US): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/us/

Rust crates
  KeepForge is built with open-source Rust crates, among them the RustCrypto
  crates (argon2, chacha20poly1305, hkdf, hmac, sha2, sha1, blake2, subtle,
  zeroize), zxcvbn, ciborium, serde, qrcode, eframe / egui, image, rfd and the
  windows crate. Each is used under its own licence (MIT and/or Apache-2.0 for
  most); see Cargo.lock for the exact versions and each crate for its terms.

Fonts
  KeepForge loads the Segoe UI and Segoe MDL2 Assets fonts that are installed
  with Windows at run time. They are not distributed with KeepForge.

